# Pantry web environment schema (Varlock).
# https://varlock.dev/guides/schema/
#
# Values live in packages/env/ (see packages/env/README.md). Web reaches the API
# through the API service binding and does not read the database directly, so it
# only needs APP_ENV. Better Auth runs in @pantry/api, so web does not pick
# BETTER_AUTH_*.
# @import(../../packages/env/, pick=[APP_ENV])
# ---
